1. DEFINITIONS

   "Engine" means the GameWorldshaper engine, editor, tools and accompanying
   source code and assets distributed under this License, in source or binary
   form, including any modification you make to them.

   "Product" means a game, application or other work that you create using the
   Engine, and that is distributed in a form intended for end users rather than
   as an engine, framework, editor or development tool.

   "Gross Revenue" means all money and other consideration you receive in
   connection with a Product, before deducting taxes, platform fees, refunds,
   costs or any other amount, and including sales, in-app purchases,
   subscriptions, advertising revenue and paid downloadable content.

   "Threshold" means USD 100,000 of lifetime Gross Revenue, counted per Product.


2. GRANT

   Subject to your compliance with this License, the Licensor grants you a
