       embeds the Engine is permitted; shipping the Engine itself as the thing
       being sold is not;
   (b) use the name "GameWorldshaper", the Licensor's name, or any confusingly
       similar name, as the name of your own engine, tool or fork, or in a way
       that suggests it is the official Engine;
   (c) remove or circumvent section 3 or section 4.


